              "text": "право (právo) — \"a right; law (as a subject)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Каждый имеет право на отдых. Kázhdyy iméyet právo na ótdykh. Everyone has the right to rest."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Neuter. Иметь право (právo) на + accusative, or + infinitive. It is also law as a subject: изучать право (právo)."
            }
          ]
        },
