          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "право (právo) is built on правый \"right, correct\", inherited from Proto-Slavic pravŭ \"right, correct\" (EtymDB): a right is what is due by what is correct."
            }
          ]
